PGG
===

PGG is derived from pok3rNetwork/pok3r (https://github.com/pok3rNetwork/pok3r),
licensed under the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2022 pok3rNetwork.

The upstream `staging` branch was imported at commit 0437e8e ("Backend Fixes (#27)")
with its full git history preserved. The original license text is kept unchanged
in the LICENSE file.

Substantial parts of the upstream code (Hardhat contracts, Express API, Next.js
client, Chainlink VRF integration) are being replaced; see docs/architecture.md
for what remains and why.
